  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Violet Youth and Community Centre</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since 2011, the Syrian crisis has severely disrupted education, livelihoods, and social networks. Vulnerable groups&#x2014;including women, children, and persons with disabilities&#x2014;face high risks of child labor, early marriage, violence, and displacement. Youth lack safe spaces and opportunities for personal and professional growth, pushing many toward negative coping mechanisms. The 2023 earthquakes revealed gaps in community-level emergency infrastructure. The proposed Center addresses these challenges by combining development programming (youth empowerment, education, recreation) with emergency response capacity, ensuring inclusion across genders, ages, and abilities.
Violet is engaging donors to support the remaining construction and cladding works for this youth centre. 
This &#xa3;20,000 GBP&#xa0; from CA Code 3 is to support the cladding work</narrative>
  </description>
